{"ts":"2026-09-05T17:49:29.138Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.6","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"79b1bc4fa5a651aa6110ddbe","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.6","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-05T17:49:29.138Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-05T17:49:29.138Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Pinned @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.5 (exact), pm-changelog 2026.9.2 (exact), and pm-ops ^2026.9.5 (caret preserved).\n\npm-changelog 2026.9.2 no longer stamps the wall clock on an unflagged run. The unflagged heading is now the bare ## <version>, where it used to be ## <version> - <today>. This repository already asserts only that the unflagged heading differs from the flagged one (scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts, since f443a7d), so the pin did not require a source change.\n\nRevert-proof against 2026.9.2: restoring the old clock-asserting control fails 4 of 21 tests in test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts (exit 1). Restoring the property that the flag must change the heading: 21 pass, 0 fail (exit 0).\n\nThe four failures against the clock-asserting control:\n- a control identical to the flagged run fails, because then the flag discriminates nothing\n- a control derived some other way still passes, because the contract is that the flag changes the heading\n- verify runs both halves against this checkout and reports through the process streams\n- main verifies this checkout and reports through the process streams\n\nObserved generator output: flagged ## 2026.1.2 - 2026-01-02, unflagged ## 2026.1.2.\n\nnpm run release:check exits 0. pm health --strict-exit exits 0."}]}],"before_hash":"f3694b29d4de961db038b8f98a2f14dde9ddd7f5089088d0d49dab16d36bbd84","after_hash":"92cbe18bec955d417cf0d9fdfa2adfd3d3d57c62023fe90ab653cba1d59a2700","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"617f70653a77ff3be789321f83c09b74481fbc75715f47faea19f39ce35c128e"}
